00:12:15.958 --> 00:12:17.250
BRIAN DORSEY: Yeah, go do that.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.470
Start some VMs and
see how they work.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.840
But I want to let you
know there's actually

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.470
a free trial and a free
tier to help you do that

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.180
and experiment with Cloud.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:28.770
CARTER MORGAN: A
trial and a tier?

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:29.850
Please explain.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.558
BRIAN DORSEY: So it's
a little confusing.

00:12:31.558 --> 00:12:33.820
They're both Ts, and like
free trial, free tier.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:37.860
So everyone new to Google Cloud
